      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ui): redesign chat composer controls",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- redesign the Control UI chat composer around a compact model/provider picker with reasoning and speed controls\n- combine chat and voice options under Settings, move attachment/camera controls, and switch the primary action between microphone, stop, and send states\n- add responsive desktop/mobile layout, five-line input growth, sender-aligned message bubbles, context/progress indicators, and scoped model-catalog compatibility handling\n\n## Behavioral proof\n\nCaptured from the real Control UI page using the repository E2E mock Gateway.\n\n### Before\n\n<img width=\"1082\" height=\"101\" alt=\"Before: desktop chat composer\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/626a654a-91d9-4542-93db-bcb8e276b366\" />\n\n[Before desktop interaction video](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cd0633b-cd15-4e68-ba3c-79322f2f713f)\n\n### After\n\n#### Desktop composer\n\n<img width=\"1082\" height=\"165\" alt=\"After: compact desktop chat composer\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8efee568-8388-4496-bfe4-daacf70f50ad\" />\n\n#### Model picker\n\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"900\" alt=\"After: provider and model picker\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86d45a4a-a8c5-4bb2-bb4d-2c3f1d2b686c\" />\n\n#### Settings, reasoning, and speed controls\n\n<img width=\"520\" height=\"332\" alt=\"After: combined chat and voice settings\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c4bf24c-2f61-4512-af74-b1c67d03e3fd\" />\n\n#### Five-line composer cap\n\n<img width=\"1082\" height=\"223\" alt=\"After: composer capped at five visible lines\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e01d2576-0665-4c7a-8e01-9aa92cae97ba\" />\n\n#### Voice recording stop state\n\n<img width=\"1082\" height=\"192\" alt=\"After: active voice recording with red stop control\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bba43ac9-7eb0-47f5-aa9f-c3cc68986086\" />\n\n#### Mobile composer and camera\n\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"167\" alt=\"After: compact mobile chat composer\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16bc8870-b736-4a5a-be3c-62660796ac52\" />\n\n<img width=\"377\" height=\"235\" alt=\"After: mobile camera capture attached to the conversation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33793cb7-69bc-40f1-ba31-c2032e88c068\" />\n\n[After desktop interaction video](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbce67c2-a4f4-43eb-b42d-50ec1a7cb879)\n\n[After mobile interaction video](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a69367a3-4810-4281-aca3-bb4adf41c0a8)\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui.config.ts --configLoader runner` (2,059 tests)\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui-e2e.config.ts --configLoader runner ui/src/e2e/chat-composer-redesign.e2e.test.ts ui/src/e2e/browser-talk-start-stop.e2e.test.ts` (6 tests)\n- `pnpm ui:i18n:check`\n- `pnpm --dir ui build`\n- `$autoreview --mode branch --base upstream/main` (clean)\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nBehavior addressed: Control UI chat composer layout, provider/model selection, reasoning and speed controls, combined chat/voice settings, attachments, mobile camera capture, voice start/stop, send-state switching, context/progress display, and message alignment.\n\nReal environment tested: Real Control UI page in Chromium at 1920x1080 desktop and 393x852 mobile, backed by the repository E2E mock Gateway.\n\nExact steps or command run after this patch: Opened Chat, selected providers/models, changed reasoning and speed, opened Settings, exercised five-line overflow, started and stopped voice capture, verified microphone-to-send switching, opened mobile camera capture, and attached the captured image.\n\nEvidence after fix: Before/after screenshots plus desktop and mobile WebM recordings attached above.\n\nObserved result after fix: The composer remains compact and centered on full desktop, exposes model/reasoning/speed controls, preserves scoped model catalogs, limits text growth to five lines, switches voice/send/stop actions correctly, and attaches mobile camera images.\n\nWhat was not tested: Physical mobile camera hardware and a live external voice provider; browser media and Gateway responses were deterministic fixtures.\n\n## Release note\n\nRedesigns the Control UI chat composer with integrated model, reasoning, speed, settings, attachment, camera, and voice controls across desktop and mobile.\n",
